{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Don't be fooled by the art style! This isn't a cat nap simulator!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/311cbc75c29b80751a020b3b17b1635d.avif?t=1772097404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras_big/311cbc75c29b80751a020b3b17b1635d.webp?t=1772097404 width=1560 height=475 /></span><i><strong>It's a Roguelite ARPG fusing fantasy storytelling, intense combat, and deep build systems! A tough battle of Cats vs. Humans to change destiny!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u26a1 Elemental System</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive web of 11 intertwining elements</strong>. Your choices determine whether you hit hard or land critical strikes! Strategy is yours to craft.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2600 Day/Night Cycle \ud83c\udf19</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow safely by day, challenge your limits by night</strong>. Will you sleep peacefully by the campfire, or fight for glory in the Eternal Night? Risk and reward are up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Skill Evolution</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform basic skills into ultimate weapons! Want <strong>a Magic Gatling Gun</strong>? <strong>A Full-Screen Nuke</strong>? <strong>Auto-tracking missiles</strong>? <strong>Massive AOE</strong>? Infinite possibilities are yours to combine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udee1 Meta Progression</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete system of Character + Weapon + Sets</strong>. Do you rely on pure skill for a clutch win? Or crush enemies with god-tier stats? As long as you grind, nothing can stop you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Combat Builds</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be <strong>a Shadow Assassin</strong> lurking in the dark? <strong>An Elemental Inquisitor</strong> controlling magic? Or <strong>a Medal Hunter</strong> decked out in divine gear? Choose your own path and style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\uddfa Hidden World</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the carefully designed stage of Septora Valley, push the story forward with tiny paws. Uncover the truth behind a world full of mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Wishlist NOW! A fantasy adventure full of suspense is about to begin!\u00a0Become &quot;Disaster Duo&quot; with Layla!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/ec6240ed37f70bd4b88c6a85f27d6f4d.poster.avif?t=1772097404\" width=1080 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/ec6240ed37f70bd4b88c6a85f27d6f4d.webm?t=1772097404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/ec6240ed37f70bd4b88c6a85f27d6f4d.mp4?t=1772097404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udfae Free Prequel Prologue (DEMO) Coming Soon!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a key plot point early and obtain the key puzzle piece to unlock the secrets of &quot;Septora Valley.&quot;<br>Experience an <strong>intense chase and counter-attack battle</strong> featuring Day/Night mechanics, Elemental counters, and Medal evolutions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Stay tuned. A &quot;cute&quot; but definitely not to be messed with adventure is starting soon.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/630b5cfe4a143d50f04dcfba977c13ca.poster.avif?t=1772097404\" width=1080 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/630b5cfe4a143d50f04dcfba977c13ca.webm?t=1772097404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/630b5cfe4a143d50f04dcfba977c13ca.mp4?t=1772097404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Layla's Prologue \u2014</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haaah... I've finally woken up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huh? An extra hair on my nose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It hits me\u2014I'm no longer the Grand Mage, nor even human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm just a little white cat who's always sleepy but can really throw down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd06By day, I'm a rescue team, an adventurer, a savior\u2026 fun and stress-free.</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf19By night, enemies are fiercer, rewards are sweeter, and I become bolder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relearning magic from scratch is a wonder in itself, full of daily surprises.<br>The magic I learn changes every day.<br><strong>\ud83d\udd25Crimson Meteor spinning and bombing, \u26a1Thunder Beast roaring deafeningly, \ud83c\udf3fBlack Thorn piercing the sky and earth, \ud83c\udf20and occasionally Golden Tear falling from above\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca4With sleepy, dazed eyes, I can still blast magic so accurately it makes enemies doubt their very purpose!</strong> <br><strong>\ud83d\udc08With a tiny, slender body, I can still slash through the sky and tear through enemy ranks with these little paws!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33Forests, \ud83c\udf3fgrasslands, \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0fruins\u2026 The world feels vast, and I've never felt smaller.<br>Even so, I will definitely find my own answers\ud83d\udc95.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2b50 Wishlist now and join me to become the ultimate &quot;Disaster Duo&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2957840?t=1772097404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/fcdbfbbd9e34b62c996a6114b2273918e4798c51/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772097404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/ed7df7def14e435cfb04a5e7cc023c8dae891a06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772097404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/ed7df7def14e435cfb04a5e7cc023c8dae891a06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772097404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4379120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Don't be fooled by the art style! This isn't a cat nap simulator!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras/311cbc75c29b80751a020b3b17b1635d.avif?t=1772097404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957840/extras_big/311cbc75c29b80751a020b3b17b1635d.webp?t=1772097404 width=1560 height=475 /></span><i><strong>It's a Roguelite ARPG fusing fantasy storytelling, intense combat, and deep build systems! A tough battle of Cats vs. Humans to change destiny!</strong></i></p><h2 clas